{"version":3,"kind":"Article","sha256":"e08cfae7c8483bf93f3d94ece11982d25616790d1d7706472aadf2432593b2c0","slug":"index","location":"/intro.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"源代码：原子物理的逆向工程","content_includes_title":false,"authors":[{"nameParsed":{"literal":"Jin Lei","given":"Jin","family":"Lei"},"name":"Jin Lei","url":"https://jinlei.fewbody.com","id":"contributors-myst-generated-uid-0"}],"github":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic","source_url":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic/blob/main/book/intro.md","edit_url":"https://github.com/jinleiphys/atomic/edit/main/book/intro.md","exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"intro.md","url":"/atomic/build/intro-7c50d55e7fd61ffeaab80863ecdf897a.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Source Code: Reverse Engineering the Atom","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"LLn8VBlCKM"}],"key":"o4HBFpThpJ"}],"key":"foQB1NUCxe"},{"type":"thematicBreak","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"UImtxaQtbP"},{"type":"blockquote","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":8,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"宇宙是一个巨大的\"黑盒\"，原子是它的基础逻辑单元。\n本书试图用两种视角，碳基直觉与硅基计算，对这个黑盒进行逆向工程。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"SC9HF88EAO"}],"key":"UOCivJmfCs"}],"key":"H1hrbWBE3R"},{"type":"thematicBreak","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"qB5GUMv2pG"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"想象你面前有一个黑盒子。你不知道里面装的是什么，也无法打开它。你唯一能做的，是往里面输入一些东西，比如一束光、一个粒子、一股能量，然后观察它吐出来什么：一条谱线、一个散射角、一个概率分布。你收集成千上万组这样的输入输出数据，然后问自己：盒子里面，究竟藏着怎样的机制？","position":{"start":{"line":12,"column":1},"end":{"line":12,"column":1}},"key":"gI1X1jeHIf"}],"key":"xYCoYow1OW"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这正是物理学家过去两百年一直在做的事情。原子太小，无法直接观察；你不能切开它看个究竟，只能通过实验去试探。卢瑟福用 α 粒子轰击金箔，记录下每一个粒子的散射角度；玻尔盯着氢原子光谱的精确数据，试图从中找出规律；海森堡和薛定谔面对更精细的实验结果，构建起量子力学的数学框架。每一次，过程都是相同的：设计实验，收集数据，提出模型，用模型去预测新的实验结果，如果预测失败，就修正模型，然后重复这个循环。","position":{"start":{"line":14,"column":1},"end":{"line":14,"column":1}},"key":"uaqNOpeK3k"}],"key":"LlnxTTvLJu"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这个过程，换一个名字，你一定不陌生：","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"kzeh28my6M"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"机器学习","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"UhhVP10tfN"}],"key":"bkiKSlomQo"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"N61hhZkWtN"}],"key":"bI0ZYoWi55"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"今天训练一个神经网络，本质上做的是同一件事。你准备大量的输入输出数据对，设计一个模型架构，让算法去调整模型的参数，使得模型的输出尽可能接近真实数据。训练完成后，你用模型去预测它从未见过的新数据；如果预测不准，你就调整架构或数据，重新训练。物理学家管这叫\"发现自然规律\"，机器学习工程师管这叫\"拟合数据\"，但剥开术语的外壳，它们是同一种认知活动：","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"Adma62Bl8k"},{"type":"strong","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"从有限的观测中，构建一个能够泛化的模型","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"JqGBbChOk7"}],"key":"rYcwtLHmmW"},{"type":"text","value":"。","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"key":"yaRHULDXHZ"}],"key":"DTF7PDCAoT"},{"type":"mermaid","value":"flowchart TD\n    A[\"实验数据 / 训练数据\"] --> B[\"提出模型 / 设计网络架构\"]\n    B --> C[\"验证预测 / 测试泛化能力\"]\n    C -->|\"如果失败，修正模型\"| B\n    C --> D[\"物理定律 / 训练好的模型\"]\n\n    style A fill:none,stroke:#333\n    style B fill:none,stroke:#333\n    style C fill:none,stroke:#333\n    style D fill:none,stroke:#333","key":"hqZxrmaNpQ"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"区别当然存在。物理学家追求的模型要足够简洁，能用几个方程写下来，能揭示背后的因果机制；而神经网络往往是巨大的黑箱，参数多达数十亿，你知道它有效，却很难说清它为什么有效。但这种区别是程度上的，不是本质上的。牛顿的万有引力定律是一个极其简洁的模型，它用一个公式 ","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"FRbRGylgC3"},{"type":"inlineMath","value":"F = Gm_1m_2/r^2","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"html":"<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F = Gm_1m_2/r^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.13889em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>","key":"wQcHTATBjF"},{"type":"text","value":" 拟合了从苹果落地到行星运行的所有数据；薛定谔方程是一个更复杂的模型，但它同样是从实验数据中\"学\"出来的，只不过学习的主体是人类的大脑，而不是GPU上的梯度下降。","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"qLKZfWvAP4"}],"key":"iwt9AsRdm9"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"原子物理是这场认知冒险中最戏剧性的一章。在这里，人类第一次发现：我们直觉中那套用来理解世界的语言，连续的轨迹、确定的位置、因果分明的演化，在微观尺度下彻底失效了。经典的\"模型架构\"无论怎么调参都无法拟合数据，我们不得不发明一套全新的架构：量子力学。这不是一次渐进的改良，而是一次范式的重建，就像从决策树跳到深度神经网络，底层的假设完全不同了。","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"QldTdAazOk"}],"key":"mLY9av2PW7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本书的标题\"源代码\"，正是对这种认知过程的隐喻。宇宙运行着某种我们看不见的\"程序\"，物理学家通过实验收集它的输入输出，然后试图逆向工程出这个程序的逻辑。我们学习原子物理，不是在背诵一堆被打包好的结论，而是在追溯这些结论是如何从数据中被\"训练\"出来的。它们是被人类的直觉、数学和无数次试错训练出来的。","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"key":"CgBGHAJbEs"}],"key":"YH1ymni383"},{"type":"thematicBreak","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"cnDA3ED11v"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"双线叙事：直觉与算法","position":{"start":{"line":41,"column":1},"end":{"line":41,"column":1}},"key":"fprmZaTNXK"}],"identifier":"id","label":"双线叙事：直觉与算法","html_id":"id","implicit":true,"key":"yhAVFAfkNm"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"本书以杨福家《原子物理学》的严谨体系为骨架，但选择了一种不同的重构方式：双线叙事。","position":{"start":{"line":43,"column":1},"end":{"line":43,"column":1}},"key":"XckvJ8CMU8"}],"key":"FIpsMOn2WL"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 碳基直觉 (Carbon-based Intuition)","position":{"start":{"line":45,"column":1},"end":{"line":45,"column":1}},"key":"V2tA5FY27w"}],"identifier":"id-1-carbon-based-intuition","label":"1. 碳基直觉 (Carbon-based Intuition)","html_id":"id-1-carbon-based-intuition","implicit":true,"key":"MAZKQGlR7w"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":46,"column":1},"end":{"line":46,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"这是人类智慧的温度所在。物理学的每一次突破，都不是从天而降的灵感，而是一个人或一群人在证据与困惑的夹缝中做出的选择。卢瑟福看到 α 粒子被大角度散射时的震惊，玻尔在经典物理的废墟上做出量子化假设时的孤注一掷。这条线追溯的是概念如何演化、图景如何更替。这是通过考试所必需的严谨知识线，也是理解物理思想的核心脉络。","position":{"start":{"line":46,"col